WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.179
Rabbit blinked in surprise.

2
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:10.566
"Hello, Rabbit," the fairy said.

3
00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:14.084
"Hello," Rabbit said.

4
00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:16.870
She was a beautiful fairy.

5
00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:20.577
She had short hair and long wings.

6
00:00:20.578 --> 00:00:26.660
The fairy waved her wand.

7
00:00:26.661 --> 00:00:29.682
Rabbit floated out of the bag.

8
00:00:29.683 --> 00:00:33.890
He landed gently on the grass.

9
00:00:33.891 --> 00:00:38.410
"You're a good friend to Henry," the fairy said.

10
00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:46.762
"Because of that, you will become a real rabbit."

11
00:00:46.763 --> 00:00:51.828
Rabbit gasped and looked down at his sack body.

12
00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:56.363
"Real . . . like the outside rabbits?" he said.

13
00:00:56.364 --> 00:00:59.065
"Is that possible?"

14
00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:07.709
The fairy laughed. "Yes, real like those rabbits.

15
00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.584
Now close your eyes.

16
00:01:10.585 --> 00:01:13.416
I will sing you a lullaby."

17
00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:17.239
But Rabbit was much too excited to sleep.

18
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.578
"Will it hurt?" he asked.

19
00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.973
"I'll need legs and feet like the real rabbits.

20
00:01:23.974 --> 00:01:25.882
And what about Henry?

21
00:01:25.883 --> 00:01:27.881
He'll miss me!"

22
00:01:27.882 --> 00:01:30.387
"Shh," the fairy said.

23
00:01:30.388 --> 00:01:32.907
"All will be well.

24
00:01:32.908 --> 00:01:39.506
Now close your eyes and let the magic come."

25
00:01:39.507 --> 00:01:41.787
Rabbit closed his eyes.

26
00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:49.399
He felt fairy dust swirl around him.

27
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.467
The fairy sang a lullaby.

28
00:01:52.468 --> 00:01:57.411
Rabbit thought of the blue lake and green mountains.

29
00:01:57.412 --> 00:02:02.273
He felt the fairy kiss his nose.

30
00:02:02.274 --> 00:02:09.390
Then he drifted off to sleep.

31
00:02:09.391 --> 00:02:13.188
When Rabbit woke up, he smelled pine trees.

32
00:02:13.189 --> 00:02:15.996
"He's awake!" a voice said.

33
00:02:15.997 --> 00:02:20.799
Slowly Rabbit opened his eyes.

